sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    participant W as Web app
    participant PS as Profile service
    participant D as Database

    S->>W: Open My Profile
    W->>PS: getProfile(userId)
    PS->>D: Read profile sports and availability
    D-->>PS: profile data
    PS-->>W: Current profile
    S->>W: Sports, skill level per sport, availability slots
    W->>PS: updateProfile(userId, sports, availability)
    alt No sport selected or slot end before start
        PS-->>W: Validation error
        W-->>S: Show message, nothing saved
    else Valid
        PS->>D: Replace PROFILE_SPORT and AVAILABILITY_SLOT rows
        PS-->>W: Saved
        W-->>S: Show updated profile
    end
